<title>USA: Select Appointments U.S. unit 1996 revs jump.</title>
<headline>Select Appointments U.S. unit 1996 revs jump.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Boston Select Group, a unit of Select Appointment (Holdings) Plc, said it had revenues of $200.5 million for 1996, a 58.45 percent increase over 1995 revenues.</p>
<p>The company said it anticipates revenue trends will continue in 1997.</p>
<p>The company said that although revenues were achieved primarily through &quot;organic growth,&quot; 1996 saw expansion throughout the United States, Europe and Asia with acquisitions in California, Netherlands and India respectively.</p>
